#
# Conformance case: quality/role-without-generic
# AC: YAMATO quality constraint — QualityRoleWithoutGeneric.
#
# ex:Q plays a quality-role (logic:qualityRole) but instantiates no generic
# quality (logic:genericQuality). A quality playing a role must instantiate the
# generic quality the role contextualizes (Principle 11 in role terms), so the
# violation rule must derive violation(Q, QualityRoleWithoutGeneric). The chase
# seeds only from input.nq world facts; this program is the mirror axiom.

@prefix logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> .
@prefix ex:    <https://example.org/quality/role-without-generic/> .

ex:Q logic:qualityRole ex:systolicRole .
